LUCENE-7188: remove incorrect sanity check in
 NRTCachingDirectory.listAll() that throws IllegalStateException

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by an incorrect sanity check in the `listAll()` method of the `NRTCachingDirectory` class, which threw an `IllegalStateException` when a file appeared in both the delegate and cache. This check was unnecessary and led to exceptions being thrown even when there was no actual conflict or issue with the files being listed.

